    {
      "id": "isle_othe_guns_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Run out and *loaded*.” He is grim about it. “Bren brought a swivel up and it is still charged. A ship that founders houses her guns. A ship with her guns run out was fighting, and there is nothing on that reef to fight.”"
        }
      ],
